{"id":"2f46583b-51ad-5a01-b290-ec6bd7d1f91e","t":"天方烨谈","art":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts125/v4/a8/56/29/a8562970-6135-3426-3d39-65d1302b3413/mza_5423696103872549466.jpg/120x120bb.jpg","coll":1211540108,"lang":"zh-cn","n":51,"episodes":[{"id":"f4a8f37d-e26e-5619-992f-44e65393be7d","t":"尹烨x陈行甲：动物都不内卷，人类为什么越学越焦虑？","d":"2026-07-17","dur":134,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJEOMAS-ABCqDAS4fZy_.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=1001471742&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/e7eb-audiofreehighqps/DA/8F/GKwRIJEOMAS-ABCqDAS4fZy_.m4a","n":"生命科学正在刷新人类对自身的认知，但最令人振奋的那个答案往往最朴素：决定生命质量的，不是基因这张底牌，而是你每天的活法。基因可以修复，器官可以再生，衰老可以干预——但这些不是靠幻想，而是靠你每一天的饮食、作息、心态。尹烨新作《与基因和解》，这是一本让你放下对基因的执念、拿起对生活…","p":["person-04d6b1"]},{"id":"19bcf877-c1b5-530f-a805-5cbbd8c454ed","t":"义利相合，知行共生：当陈行甲遇上俞敏洪","d":"2026-01-22","dur":313,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIaINR7q7ACayTQRd1kg2.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=951248280&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/9c4e-audiofreehighqps/66/11/GKwRIaINR7q7ACayTQRd1kg2.m4a","n":"陈行甲与俞敏洪的握手，让150万年薪成为社会价值新坐标，这场跨界合作正重新定义理想与现实的边界——不是空谈奉献，而是让解决问题的行动真正落地生根。","p":[]},{"id":"953a2863-f4f9-5830-928d-efcd0e81a1fe","t":"尹烨x姚洋：适者生存？错！是适者合作","d":"2025-12-24","dur":255,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIRwNIbsXAB-GwgRNA1cT.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=943391172&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/a44f-audiofreehighqps/F4/35/GKwRIRwNIbsXAB-GwgRNA1cT.m4a","n":"我们常常听到“适者生存”这个说法,但它给我们带来了一个误区,让我们误以为只有通过竞争才能生存。然而,适者生存的核心其实是合作。","p":[]},{"id":"85251397-670b-5a0f-a700-321c8f2b851e","t":"尹烨x姚洋：技术本身无罪，使用技术的人有善恶","d":"2024-10-30","dur":109,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIUEK9087AAo7FgMm9u1w.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=769880547&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/3865-audiofreehighqps/7E/02/GKwRIUEK9087AAo7FgMm9u1w.m4a","n":"科技向善，善在其心。基因编辑不可用于定制婴儿，技术本身无罪，但使用技术的人有善恶之分。","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"08157479-ba02-5266-98c3-c41872cf1a67","t":"尹烨x姚洋：生育率下降实际是因为技术发展？","d":"2024-10-27","dur":183,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJIK810CABEW0gMlan30.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=768930346&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/c9e3-audiofreehighqps/46/7F/GKwRIJIK810CABEW0gMlan30.m4a","n":"随着人工智能技术的不断发展，越来越多的人开始感受到了AI给我们生活带来的便利和改变。那么，我们应该如何适应AI改变生活...","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"7f13e3aa-89af-5010-a5eb-300a4c5bfa88","t":"尹烨x姚洋：时代的洪流不可抗拒，个体如何应对？","d":"2024-10-24","dur":268,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRINsK72j9ABj2XgMjsH_x.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=768051570&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/5708-audiofreehighqps/08/38/GKwRINsK72j9ABj2XgMjsH_x.m4a","n":"技术进步是否总是无情地淘汰旧职业？但总有新机会等着我们。面对AI冲击，要正确认识科技发展，积极提升自我，勇于拥抱变革，便能在新时代找到属于自己的舞台，实现个人价值与社会发展的共赢。","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"73f869b5-8630-53c1-a372-6ce0657fa54e","t":"尹烨x姚洋：人类会因为技术而毁灭吗？","d":"2024-10-23","dur":179,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIDoK7hS4ABDAlAMjKYYk.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=767750718&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/a973-audiofreehighqps/C7/80/GKwRIDoK7hS4ABDAlAMjKYYk.m4a","n":"科技的迅猛发展，给人类带来了前所未有的便捷与高效，然而，在这令人瞩目的成就背后，我们也不得不正视那些由科技引发的潜在危机。许多人工智能（AI）研究者认为，超人类人工智能的发展有可能导致人类灭绝，但对此类风险也存在广泛的分歧和不确定性。","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"cf3cdd71-4d6f-551b-a148-22ed0b985978","t":"尹烨x姚洋：“大力出奇迹”的人工智能具有遍历性吗？","d":"2024-10-21","dur":157,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIMAK63HlAA6nPQMiDS1D.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=767125939&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/153f-audiofreehighqps/50/05/GKwRIMAK63HlAA6nPQMiDS1D.m4a","n":"人工智能技术的迅猛发展，被认为是推动全球经济重塑主要动力。而技术的快速迭代也预示着，我们所见到的生成式AI的力量仅仅初见端倪，未来极有可能发生更有颠覆性的技术变革。","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"9b95e905-cf99-56fc-b1ac-dbe9a8c2eae1","t":"尹烨x姚洋：人工智能离达到人的智力还有多远？","d":"2024-10-19","dur":566,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJIK6Jm7ADStJwMg_dp8.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=766521346&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/07f5-audiofreehighqps/6F/BF/GKwRIJIK6Jm7ADStJwMg_dp8.m4a","n":"从算力爆发到语音视频生成，AI正以惊人的速度进化。大模型开始具备数理逻辑，不再是简单的文本生成工具，而能理解复杂问题，未来将如何发展？","p":["person-0afc29"]},{"id":"47db2a6a-ec3c-5a29-95b8-b916aa71c48e","t":"尹烨x江南春：很多慢性病都是从睡不好觉开始的","d":"2024-07-29","dur":109,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJEKfLO4AAo3xwL30_k-.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=744575288&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/e8e9-audiofreehighqps/16/F1/GKwRIJEKfLO4AAo3xwL30_k-.m4a","n":"睡眠很关键，很多慢性病都是从睡不好觉开始的。","p":["person-070a3c"]},{"id":"a791772a-f512-5a98-bf69-ef6d83df1e79","t":"尹烨x吴军：担忧人工智能是杞人忧天吗？","d":"2024-07-23","dur":161,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJIKdMquAA8PLQL0_PzX.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=743202374&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/8dd6-audiofreehighqps/32/6A/GKwRIJIKdMquAA8PLQL0_PzX.m4a","n":"现在人工智能做的事还太少，而不是太多。","p":["person-c31522"]},{"id":"a912b36a-e86e-5e8e-b513-ab54e2704ee8","t":"尹烨x江南春：百岁人生来了，我们要做哪些准备？","d":"2024-07-21","dur":162,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIaIKcie5AA8r6gL0CR51.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=742751906&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/4a18-audiofreehighqps/F1/81/GKwRIaIKcie5AA8r6gL0CR51.m4a","n":"百岁人生来了，除了保持锻炼、终身学习，还需要及时攒够钱。","p":["person-070a3c"]},{"id":"d77f765f-440f-52a9-b34e-7adcbf7a9339","t":"尹烨x吴军：历史上大部分都是循环，少数时候是进步","d":"2024-07-14","dur":121,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIMAKaO9cAAtJ9QLwmiLA.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=741215021&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/a65d-audiofreehighqps/FC/01/GKwRIMAKaO9cAAtJ9QLwmiLA.m4a","n":"无论是经济还是人均预期寿命，真正进步都是改革开放以后这几十年。","p":["person-c31522"]},{"id":"2a6bcf64-03df-54ef-85c5-7dafb3749800","t":"尹烨x冯唐：挣钱不丢人，物质是一切的基础","d":"2024-06-20","dur":108,"a":"https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIUEKSUlPAA1zuQLkbcyf.m4a?channel=rss&album_id=3881168&track_id=736063626&uid=44841033&jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/5c06-audiofreehighqps/C7/F1/GKwRIUEKSUlPAA1zuQLkbcyf.m4a","n":"物质是一切文明的基础。","p":["person-887e6e"]},{"id":"292c85da-796a-57c6-9